{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/665084-recruiting-for-an-online-beast-the-primordial-game","id":665084,"title":"Recruiting for an Online Beast: The Primordial Game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-14T17:34:35-07:00","id":665084,"title":"Recruiting for an Online Beast: The Primordial Game","content":"<b>Hello friends!</b><br /> <br /> My name is Jacob. I am starting a Beast: The Primordial chronicle over on roll20 and would like to see if anyone is interested. <i>Be warned that my games tend towards being slightly surreal, not entirely serious, and more narrative than action-packed or dice heavy. </i><br /> <br /> What I have:<ul><li><i>Experience Storytelling in two previous WOD Chronicles and playing in three others</i></li> <li><i>Two players</i></li> </ul>What I need:<ul><li><i>An additional three to four people to participate in a predominately Beast game</i></li> <li><i>A chance to explore this exciting new game</i></li> </ul>Our first session will be devoted to the discussion of the game as a whole, decisions about the setting and crossover potential, and character creation.<br /> <br /> If you have played with me before (Alejandro? Patrik? I don't know how to contact you guys, but if you're still there, let me know) I'll be more than happy to have you.<br /> <br /> I am <i>no stranger to teaching games</i> so even if you've never played a game online, never actually played a WOD game, or even if you've never played any RPGs at all, <i>I will happily accommodate you.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1063-kajedhorrors","name":"kajedhorrors","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T20:51:17-07:00","id":665306,"title":"","content":"Any idea what the time slots would be? I'm interested in trying Beast, but my schedule's a bit tight.<br /> <br /> I'm a tad nervous about the &quot;slightly surreal&quot; part... there'd be <i>some </i>action, at least, right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-15T01:53:36-07:00","id":665467,"title":"","content":"I'm interested as well, but I too need to know the time. My schedule is pretty flexible right now though, so it shouldn't be much of a problem.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/477-xenorath","name":"Xenorath","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar477_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"169"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-15T02:42:11-07:00","id":665491,"title":"","content":"Interested; need to know time slot.<br /> An idea of the expected play style would be nice; surreal is one of the more subjective abjectives. Haven't really played online before, so will suffer the learning curve.<br /> <br /> Any details on the setting or preferred character niches? I don't want to step on anyone's toes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-15T07:00:20-07:00","id":665659,"title":"","content":"Interested as well, but need to know time slot again as well. Also I haven't actually been able to play a WoD game as of yet, only a year long Scion game, and some D&amp;D experience.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/24296274/BeastThePrimordial.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6566-draca","name":"Draca","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6566_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-15T10:27:38-07:00","id":665858,"title":"","content":"Thank you all for your interest!<br /> <br /> I will now attempt to address each of your concerns.<br /> <br /> <b>Re: Timeslot</b><br /> I will need to confer with my existing player, but as of now I don't have any real time commitments of my own, so the answer to this question is essentially: &quot;whatever time I can get the most people together.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Re: Playstyle</b><br /> My previous games tended towards investigation, exploration, and roleplaying more than combat or any other sort of action, but I intend to run a very character driven game, so action may arise in places where it makes sense. It will mostly be up to the players to seek action if you want it.<br /> <br /> <b>Re: Surrealism</b><br /> You're right about surreal being a subjective term, I might have better said unsettling or bizarre, but those probably aren't any better. Imagine this instead:<br /> <br /> <i>You climb the creaking steps to the second floor of the derelict casino. Your shoes are damp from the constant rain outside. Your friends and loved ones sit in a loose circle at the top of the stairs. They moan quietly and rock back and forth. A robed creature with a deer's antlers, a llama's face, an old man's gnarled hands, and a second, <b>human</b> mouth behind its gaping ungulate lips sits in the center of the circle. His first mouth screams, and his second mouth howls words of dire prophecy. His name is Jerry.</i><br /> <br /> That legitimately happened in my last mage game. That should give you an idea of the level I usually reach.<br /> <br /> <b>Re: Online play</b><br /> Roll20 is very easy to use and very easy to teach. With our help, you'll get up to speed in no time.<br /> <br /> <b>Re: Setting and Character Niches</b><br /> I believe character creation should be at least partially a communal activity. For exactly the reason you pointed out. Nobody's toes will get stepped on if everyone's on the same page to begin with. As for the setting, the Beast book's storytelling section suggests waiting to nail down details until the characters are created, so you end up in a reasonable location for everyone's character concepts. We'll discuss that in the first session.<br /> <br /> <b>Re: New to Wod</b><br /> We had a few players who were new to Wod last time around, and with this being a new game line, I think we'll all be on fairly even footing anyway. It should be no trouble at all to get you acclimated to the game.<br /> <br /> @WarDragon, Xenowrath, FallenEco, Draca: If you are still interested, knowing all this, you may post your availability here in the forum so we can start narrowing it down, or you can send me a private message.<br /> <br /> <u>Please feel free to ask any questions you still need answered!</u>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1063-kajedhorrors","name":"kajedhorrors","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-15T18:16:35-07:00","id":666257,"title":"","content":"I am interested too. I hope you can make room for one more. I haven't played an RPG in a while and would be happy join. Will the game be set in a real life city or a made up one?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-15T18:57:48-07:00","id":666298,"title":"","content":"I'm also pretty interested, and I have a fair bit of flexibility on time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-15T19:10:03-07:00","id":666306,"title":"","content":"I've played RPGs almost entirely online, so that part's nothing new. Never actually sat down to play WoD, though, so that'll be new; my prior experience is mostly with D&amp;D and Exalted. I've got the core book and God Machine update, though, and have read the fluff for the other splats. Exalted's system is... very broadly similar to WoD, with some significant differences.<br /> <br /> That level of weirdness isn't a problem for me.<br /> <br /> As for timing, I am in the Eastern time zone, USA. My Friday evenings,and Sundays are pretty much booked. Saturdays are open, though that is subject to change, depending on my other group's schedule, unfortunately. Could do it on a weeknight at 6 or 7 and go to 12 or 1, I tend to stay up too late anyway.<br /> <br /> Got a character idea or two... somehow, criminals seem to jump to the fore when I think of a Beast PC.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-15T19:17:52-07:00","id":666309,"title":"","content":"I'm interested in playing I'm in MDT so it is 8:17 as I write this. I am free on Saturday, every other Sunday, and Monday","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7525,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7525-quinn-h","user":"Quinn H.","date":". 09-15-2015, 10:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7525-quinn-h","name":"Quinn H.","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-15T20:06:19-07:00","id":666350,"title":"","content":"After the day I've had and with so many people who are applying, I think I'll step back. I've realized my life is too hectic right now and its only going to become more so soon enough. Hope you all have fun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/24296274/BeastThePrimordial.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6566-draca","name":"Draca","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6566_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-15T20:11:39-07:00","id":666355,"title":"","content":"Got room for a pilot? I'm on the West Coast.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-15T20:32:43-07:00","id":666410,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>kajedhorrors</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/665084-recruiting-for-an-online-beast-the-primordial-game?p=665858#post665858\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">@WarDragon, Xenowrath, FallenEco, Draca: If you are still interested, knowing all this, you may post your availability here in the forum so we can start narrowing it down, or you can send me a private message.</div> </div> </div> </div>That sounds awesome, count me in.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/477-xenorath","name":"Xenorath","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar477_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"169"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-16T10:57:33-07:00","id":667262,"title":"","content":"Also posting interest in this","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7459-themoonlightshadow13","name":"themoonlightshadow13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7459_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-16T11:54:11-07:00","id":667316,"title":"","content":"Wow alright, we've got more than enough people now : P<br /> I wasn't expecting to have so many people interested...<br /> <br /> @WarDragon: By merit of being the first, you are in the game. I am also in the eastern U.S. timezone (UTC-4, until daylight savings), and your availability is noted.<br /> <br /> @Xenowrath: You're in, there shouldn't be a problem there.<br /> <br /> @FallenEco: You're fourteen hours ahead of me, so I really don't know for sure that we'll be able to coordinate, especially with the other players' availability but I hope we can work it out.<br /> <br /> @GottaGoFeast: Since Draca dropped out, you're in as well. The game will likely be set in a real city or a close facsimile of a real city.<br /> <br /> @everyone else: I will post here again if the current set of players doesn't fully work out, but until then I am afraid we are at capacity. Thank you so much for your interest, and good luck in your future endeavors.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1063-kajedhorrors","name":"kajedhorrors","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-16T12:27:54-07:00","id":667352,"title":"","content":"Greetings all! I am the mysterious and oh-so-fancy pre-confirmed player O_O! As for my availability:<br /> <br /> [Keep in mind, all these times are for USA Pacific Time, AKA GMT -8]<br /> -Any time during after 6pm on weekdays [although sometimes I work later than that...:'(]<br /> -Any time on Saturday so long as game is done by 5pm (I have a Changeling LARP to attend every 2nd and 4th Saturday of the month at 5pm in the evening)<br /> -Any time Sunday (just so long as it doesn't keep me up super late into the night).<br /> <br /> As for my little throw in for the hosting ST, Kajedhorrors is a really great guy. He works very amenably with what players are trying to accomplish, writes interesting noir style stories, is good at bringing in the morally-gray element to the universe, and is quite skilled at writing a memorable and entertaining/horrifying cast of NPCs. In our last game together, I did some incredibly awful plots in the background and he was really good at coordinating with me so that the other players wouldn't yet know what is going on so long as I covered my tracks well in game (which I did). Moral of that story was: Never trust a mage who takes the shadowname of &quot;Iago.&quot; Just don't do it. It is a <b>bad</b> idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2075-cardran","name":"Cardran","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"157"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-16T16:45:33-07:00","id":667604,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cardran</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/665084-recruiting-for-an-online-beast-the-primordial-game?p=667352#post667352\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Greetings all! I am the mysterious and oh-so-fancy pre-confirmed player O_O! As for my availability:<br /> <br /> [Keep in mind, all these times are for USA Pacific Time, AKA GMT -8]<br /> -Any time during after 6pm on weekdays [although sometimes I work later than that...:'(]<br /> -Any time on Saturday so long as game is done by 5pm (I have a Changeling LARP to attend every 2nd and 4th Saturday of the month at 5pm in the evening)<br /> -Any time Sunday (just so long as it doesn't keep me up super late into the night).</div> </div> </div> </div>All those times should work for me, except Sundays unless everyone is willing to play at like 9 PM PST.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/477-xenorath","name":"Xenorath","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar477_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"169"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-16T18:09:23-07:00","id":667679,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cardran</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/665084-recruiting-for-an-online-beast-the-primordial-game?p=667352#post667352\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Greetings all! I am the mysterious and oh-so-fancy pre-confirmed player O_O! As for my availability:<br /> <br /> [Keep in mind, all these times are for USA Pacific Time, AKA GMT -8]<br /> -Any time during after 6pm on weekdays [although sometimes I work later than that...:'(]<br /> -Any time on Saturday so long as game is done by 5pm (I have a Changeling LARP to attend every 2nd and 4th Saturday of the month at 5pm in the evening)<br /> -Any time Sunday (just so long as it doesn't keep me up super late into the night).</div> </div> </div> </div>The first two work for me as well; when my other group does play on Saturdays, we rarely start that early, and on weekdays, I work until 8-9 PST.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-16T21:01:47-07:00","id":667760,"title":"","content":"Should be fine, I can adapt...as long as I still have time for work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-16T21:36:16-07:00","id":667800,"title":"","content":"I would really love to be a part of this game. I love NWoD, though I don't really have any experience with the God-Machine rules update. It's actually 6:34 as I write this, so I'm not sure how it translates to you guys. Also, I'm free most evenings from 4:00, though I'm in school so homework way take up some evenings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7372-lady-gray","name":"Lady Gray","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7372_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-16T22:55:46-07:00","id":667845,"title":"","content":"It's looking like midday Saturday is going to be the hot spot, assuming I'm calculating this all right. I'm in Eastern time, which is three hours ahead of Pacific, so 6 PM is 9 PM for me. 2 PM Pacific time is probably the optimal time with all the various constraints.Will the four of you that I mentioned in my last post be able to do that this Saturday?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1063,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1063-kajedhorrors","user":"kajedhorrors","date":". 09-17-2015, 01:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1063-kajedhorrors","name":"kajedhorrors","avatar":"d