3,"title":"","content":"Hey there, just wanted to chime in since I finally remembered what my username/password is for this thing.<br /> <br /> I am the other pre-confirmed player mentioned in the first post. Looking forward to playing with you all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1108-wolffan","name":"wolffan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T17:09:09-07:00","id":669014,"title":"","content":"That's 5 pm for me, I <i>should </i>be able to make that. I have some plans, but they should be done by then, and the rest of the day is open. Future weeks, no plans that I know of in that slot, though if Cardran has to be done by then, it may not work for him going forward?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T21:07:49-07:00","id":669207,"title":"","content":"Cardran is in the Pacific time zone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1063-kajedhorrors","name":"kajedhorrors","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T21:40:43-07:00","id":669212,"title":"","content":"Okay, right, so 2pm is 5pm for us ESTers, that gives him three hours